{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13458","headline":"海上诗送薛文学归海东 · 刘眘虚","name":"海上诗送薛文学归海东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处归且远，送君东悠悠。\n沧溟千万里，日夜一孤舟。\n旷望绝国所，微茫天际愁。\n有时近仙境，不定若梦游。\n或见青色古，孤山百里秋。\n前心方杳眇，後路劳夷犹。\n离别惜吾道，风波敬皇休。\n春浮花气远，思逐海水流。\n日暮骊歌後，永怀空沧洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘眘虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}